{"id":"rayos","lemma":"rayos","pos":"intj","rank":1171,"glosses":["dang it, goddammit, heck"],"ipa":"/ˈraʝos/","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué rayos es esto?","en":"What in the world is this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598563"},{"text":"Los rayos pueden ser peligrosos.","en":"Lightning can be dangerous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69906"},{"text":"Huele a mil rayos aquí.","en":"It really stinks in here."},{"text":"No me dan miedo los rayos.","en":"I'm not afraid of lightning."},{"text":"Pueden haber rayos durante una tormenta.","en":"Lightning can occur during a storm."}]}